    <string name="data_storage">Deftordu dokke</string>
    <string name="data_storage_intro">Retro Player ina jogoo dottaaɗe app e nder lowre nokkuure tokosere. Miijo maa e doggol pijirlooji maa ina keddii no fiiluuji no woorunoo e nder foldere nde cuɓ-ɗaa.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_title">Dataaji app</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_body">Fiilde: %1$s\nLaawol: %2$s\n\nMooftirɗo ɗaɗi defterdu, ngonka feerorde, resume pijirlooji, equalizer, tiitoonde, e ɓuranɗe ɗemngal.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_title">Fiildeeji jimɗi</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_body">Fiildeeji odiyooji ɗii meeɗaa ƴeewteede e nder lowre app. Ɓeydu foldere defterdu e Retro Player ina jannga piille gila e disko.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_title">Fiildeeji doggol pijirlooji</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_body">Doggol pijirlooji ko piille .m3u laaɓtuɗe mooftaaɗe e nder doggol defterdu maa. Aɗa waawi waylude ɗe e nder app walla e kala waylude binndol.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_title">Plateau: %1$s</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_permissions_title">Jaɓɗe Android e desorɗe</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_native_body">Retro Player ina moofta lowre mum e nder nokku ballal app-private e dow mooftirgel nder. Fiildeeji maa jimɗi ina keddii e foldere nde cuɓ-ɗaa e cuɓoowo foldere sisteem.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_title">Pijirlooji Android</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_body">So odiyo ina fijira, Retro Player ina dogna sarwiis media yeeso ngam fijirde ndee jokka so a udditii telefoŋ walla a waylii appliiji, tawa aɗa jogii jokkondire yah-ngartaa e nder humpito system. So a ƴettii app oo e Recents, ɗum haɗat ƴeewndo ngoo, itta humpito ngoo.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_body_android">Dowlaaji app ina mooftaa e nokku ballal app-private e dow mooftirgel nder.</string>
